g record content.\n\nValidation is tied to frozen implementation `e375f4c2db9fe9644caba87690b91b8ddd71e207`. The fresh source census covers 78 chart scopes and 84 pattern calls; React and Vue each pass 489 native component tests and all six theme scopes. The fresh packed runtime passes all 154 canonical cells, four separately counted dashboard cells, and 48 application chart theme checks at that same head. The five-suite capture and CI are in progress; their raw reports and final audit will be added to the handoff.\n\nLimits remain explicit: 13 patterns are authoring-only, seven core-profile cells are typed gaps, nine chart types retain typed HC render failures, and bubble-map accuracy can produce certified but nonconformant results. ECharts object placement remains deferred under decision 1944; strict soak retention is not established under decision 1946. Component theme-root measurements do not certify the fixed gallery SVG fixture paints.\n\nThe review handoff retains the full source diff, per-mission and per-hunk attribution, original palette migration, mutation evidence, and failed/interrupted observations. `builderSelfCertified:false`; independent review is still required. The three Sprint 196 reconnect notices are prepared and unsent.\n","created_at":"2026-09-12T00:30:37Z","updated_at":"2026-09-12T00:30:37Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"738d9b9999f854783498135b5e846faef4538c83","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kneelinghorse/OODS-Forge/pulls/101/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kneelinghorse/OODS-Forge/pulls/101/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kneelinghorse/OODS-Forge/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kneelinghorse/OODS-Forge/issues/101/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kneelinghorse/OODS-Forge/statuses/54def3aa